TI  - Systematic review of probiotics for the treatment of community-acquired acute diarrhea in children
AU  - Jennifer A. Applegate
AU  - Christa L. Fischer Walker
AU  - Ramya Ambikapathi
AU  - Robert E. Black
JO  - BMC Public Health
PY  - 2013
VL  - 13
IS  - S3
