TI  - Smectite in the Treatment of Acute Diarrhea: A Nationwide Randomized Controlled Study of the Italian Society of Pediatric Gastroenterology and Hepatology (SIGEP) in Collaboration With Primary Care Pediatricians
AU  - Alfredo Guarino
