TI  - <i>Saccharomyces boulardii</i> plus azithromycin is superior to azithromycin alone in reducing the duration of diarrhea in children with acute colitis: a double-blind randomized placebo-controlled trial
AU  - Mitra Ahmadi
AU  - Neda Mohtasham
AU  - Ahmad Shamsizadeh
AU  - Hazhir Javaherizadeh
AU  - Bahman Cheraghian
AU  - Masumeh Alizadeh
JO  - Immunopathologia Persa
PY  - 2022
